# Feature development

Do **not** start coding on “Implement X”. Follow `.cursor/workflows/implement-feature.md` (Understand → Impact → Plan → Implement → Validate → Audit → Report).

Scope from the **owning module spec** and Build Order. Reuse existing modules, RPCs, guards, and `mintFreshIntegrationCompany`. Do not implement deferred items to “be complete.”

Report with `.cursor/templates/engineering-task.md`. Completion checklist: `.cursor/checklists/feature-complete.md`.